Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,₹30,213 crore ka IPO,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.02,0:00:04.37,Default,,0,0,0,,India ka sabse bada.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.37,0:00:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Aapke liye isme kya hai?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.17,0:00:11.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Jio Platforms ne anchor investors ko
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.33,0:00:13.82,Default,,0,0,0,,7.247 crore shares diye.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.82,0:00:16.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Price tha ₹1,119 per share.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.18,0:00:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Bade institutions ne ₹2.5 trillion ki
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.12,0:00:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,bids daali.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.92,0:00:23.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Demand 30 guna se zyada thi.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.04,0:00:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Kyun itni demand?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.48,0:00:28.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Upper band par company ki value
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.36,0:00:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,lagbhag ₹10.3 trillion hai.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.53,0:00:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Mutual funds bhi anchor book mein
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.96,0:00:33.27,Default,,0,0,0,,hain,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.27,0:00:35.09,Default,,0,0,0,,yaani aapka SIP bhi.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.54,0:00:36.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Aapke liye matlab:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.84,0:00:39.43,Default,,0,0,0,,minimum lot 12 shares ka hai.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.43,0:00:42.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Eligible employees ko ₹54 per share
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.28,0:00:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,discount.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.25,0:00:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Saal ke andar becha,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.00,0:00:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,to profit par 20% tax lagega.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.07,0:00:50.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeh investment advice nahi hai.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.36,0:00:52.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Faisla apne advisor se pooch kar
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.64,0:00:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,,lijiye.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.55,0:00:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Aap khud apply karenge,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.46,0:00:56.83,Default,,0,0,0,,ya SIP ke raste?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.83,0:00:58.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Comment mein bataiye.
